      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `a447249e0a58866b48099a9c299936dfc764575da4d2498ee18fb41ba93d683d--5.-victims-of-fdv-related-offences.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2018\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | bc2f1607ba51a68fc692d8f0bcdcc1210c2024608f63e295b4f1718ca113285d | missing |\n| \"Table 22\" | 6762f4f639487e3386e6c3aaab03afabd6b54b04108a283e85431a50e7c5e7bc | missing |\n| \"Table 23\" | f2cbf5265c727a9675aaf46948653099fa3e221b2b5bcb775d8f57af29c8fc7a | missing |\n| \"Table 24\" | a87a5bd11a79bc55d8520fd106636cbcb41153ebbe0568d8fbf99f08b3a77c17 | missing |\n| \"Table 25\" | 8e680e786c8225bac60da9830f78f062fcc8105aa46ece639583bd00450218e5 | missing |\n| \"Table 26\" | e0068e8e5049b03bae0b95f32c0e0d005791cf750b62f1f7d07fbe88654823a9 | missing |\n| \"Table 27\" | b5e817c13243cf4cfa62f1025aa5bb9f824b6fd5ebb3f55a4bbdba8e8895151a | missing |\n| \"Table 28\" | cd1d8ba5d1bff97ea85febeaf9702e17dce76572f936379ed6a679741a8d525f | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
